abstract: >-
  Fixed-point Zig reference implementation of the FSOT neural mind: multi-region
  brain, 64-codon genetics and episodic memory, zero free parameters. Haskell
  and Idris 2 twins (fsot-neuron-haskell, fsot-neuron-idris) are held to the
  same accuracy gates.
keywords: [fsot, zig, computational-neuroscience, genetics]
